provenance               7s      0 check(s)  check-provenance: 0 problems
minimal-ofx             10s    562 check(s)  all Windows checks passed
minimal-cuda-ofx        23s    486 check(s)  all Windows checks passed
minimal-opencl-ofx      15s    392 check(s)  OK: the OpenCL template passed on this machine
minimal-vulkan-ofx      18s    588 check(s)  all Windows checks passed
onnx-inference-ofx      26s    778 check(s)  all checks passed
negative-controls       12s    223 check(s)  8 control(s) caught, every one expected
# total: sum of the rows above, not one continuous run - the negative controls
# were a separate invocation about a minute later (see the header).
total                  116s

